t=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>5</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">One per character and by saying <i>item name</i>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-3\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-4\">With Lemonade.</li><li id=\"w-notes-5\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine\">Wine</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Boozer.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Boozer</strong>: Welcome to the {Hard Rock Racing Track}, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nBoozer: I am the bartender here at the racing track.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>racing track</b><br/>\nBoozer: I sell bread, cheese, ham, meat and cookies. If you are thirsty, I can offer you beer, wine, water or lemonade. So, is it {food} or {drinks}?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nBoozer: Just call me Boozer. Everyone does that.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nBoozer: No clue, girl/boy.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>news</b><br/>\nBoozer: The swamp elves, down at Shadowthorn, are up to some trouble again.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b> or <b>Tibianus</b><br/>\nBoozer: The king is far away, so who cares?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibia</b><br/>\nBoozer: People from all over Tibia come here to buy, sell, gamble, and get drunk until they puke.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Excalibug</b><br/>\nBoozer: Heard about it now and then. Then again, I also hear there is a bogeyman somewhere in the swamps.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Bogeyman</b><br/>\nBoozer: Just a tale to scare the kids.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>army</b><br/>\nBoozer: Good customers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Ferumbras</b><br/>\nBoozer: Guess he'd be bad news for business.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>amazons</b><br/>\nBoozer: I guess they just have not met the right man yet.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></b><br/>\nBoozer: Heard about that women there. I must pay them a visit someday.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></b><br/>\nBoozer: If you like Thais so much, just go there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>buy</b> or <b>sell</b><br/>\nBoozer: I can offer you food and drinks. Get anything else somewhere else and don't bother me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>food</b><br/>\nBoozer: Bread, ham, cheese, meat, cookies. If you wanna <b>trade</b>, tell me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Drink</b><br/>\nBoozer: Beer, wine, lemonade, water. If you wanna <b>trade</b>, tell me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\nBoozer: Sure, take what you want.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nBoozer: You'll be back.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Boozer</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["kissing-a-pig-quest","loose-ends-quest","the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","the-ultimate-booze-quest"],"pos":{"x":32921,"y":32068,"z":5}}